    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamoiho omu bagurusi ba Isiraeli bagya banyijaho, banshutama omu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama angambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w'omuntu, abashaija aba emitima yabo bagimalire aha bihuuku, ebihuuku ebilikubasitaza bakafakara nibyo bataireho amaisho. Mbwenu aho inye nyikilize kabanyehanuzaho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo obagambire, ogire oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Kaishe buli Muisiraeli alikumalira omutimagwe aha bihuuku, ebihuuku ebilikumusitaza akafakara akaba nibyo aikara ahangire amaisho, kandi akashuba kwija aha murangi, inye nyenene Omukama ndamwehoroza, muture ebihuukubye ebyo ebingi muno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbone kugarura emitima y'eihanga lya Isiraeli, abahugwirwe ebihuuku byobo bakampwaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orw'ekyo ogambire eihanga lya Isiraeli oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Mwechuze, mutane n'ebihuuku byanyu, ebishushani ebyo byona mulekere kubileba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaishe MwIsiraeli, anga omugenyi afurukiire omuli Isiraeli, alikunshenga, omutimagwe akagumalira aha bihuuku, ebihuuku ebimusitaza akafakara akaba nibyo aleba, kandi akashuba akaija aha murangi kumubaza ekyo ndikugamba, inye nyenene Omukama ndamwehoroza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omuntu ogwo ndamuta omu kaso, balimuleberaho bamuchweho omugani, mara muchwe omw'ihanga lyange, kandi nainywe mulimanya okwo Omukama aba inye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'omurangi alyebelerwa akagira ekyo yagamba, inye, Omukama, n'inye ndiba munagiire, nshube nyimukye omukono mwite, muchwe omw'ihanga lyange Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balibona ekibonabonyio. Ekibonabonyio eky'omurangi n'ekibonabonyio eky'omuraguza kiliba kimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho eihanga lya Isiraeli liliba litakinshenga rundi, kandi baliba batakifakara kuhagara. Ekiliho baliba bantu bange, nanye ndiba Ruhanga wabo. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agya angambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w'omuntu, k'ensi elinfakalira ekangokera, nanye nkaimukya omukono nkagibonabonyia, nkabaletera enjara, nkabateza eifa, nkagimaramu abantu n'ebitunganwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'orwo abantu aba bashatu: Noa, Danieli na Yobu bakugishangirwemu, bakukilize oburora obwabo bwonkai aha rw'obugorogoki bwabo. Alikugamba n'inye Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandisindika ebikaaka kutabalira ensi bikaita abantu, ensi ekasilika, kugoba aha nsi kutarabwamu muntu aha rw'ebikaaka ebyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'orwo abashatu aba ensi bakugishangirwemu, n'inyerahira inye Ruhanga Omukama, na batabani babo na bahara babo bonkai tibakubakilize. Bonene bonkai nibo bakurokokire, kyonkai ensi yakubaire matongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anga kanakusindikire endashana omu nsi, nkagamba nti, ‘Ensi yona emarweho endashana,’ nkaita abantu nkabamaramu n'enyamaishwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'orwo abashatu aba bakushangirwe ensi bagilimu, n'inyerahira inye Ruhanga Omukama, na batabani babo na bahara babo bonkai tibakubakilize, shana bonene bashai nibo bakurokokire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anga ensi ngisindikire endwara, nginigalire, abantu mbaite mbamaremu hamoi n'enyamaishwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'orwo Noa, Danieli na Yobu bakugishangirwemu, inye Ruhanga Omukama n'inyerahira okwo na batabani babo na bahara babo bonkai tibakubarokoire. Bonene bashai nibo bakurokokire aha rw'obugorogoki bwabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Lero Kandateza Yerusalemu ebibonabonyio biinai eby'amaani: Endashana, eifa, ebikaka n'endwara, abantu n'enyamaishwa nkabaita kayaba, biraba bitai! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kahaliba hagizire ab'okuhonokaho bakahonora na batabani babo na bahara babo, ahanyuma bakaija ahali inywe, mulileba ebigiro byabo n'ebyo balikukora. Mulisima aha rw'enaku ezo ndiba nteize Yerusalemu, n'ebibonabonyio byona ebyo ndiba ngihaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamulibona ebigiro byabo n'ebyo balikukora mulibashemelerwa. Kandi mulimanya okwo Yerusalemu ndiba ntagihaire bibonabonyio bya bushai. Alikugamba n'inye Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
